[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Time: 4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Time in coffee shop: $ t $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Convert time to hours: $ t $ minutes = $ \frac{t}{60} $ hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
