[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Subtract equation (1) from equation (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \left( \frac{540}{s + 2} + t \right) - \left( \frac{540}{s} + t \right) = 144 - 240
