[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m where $ A $ is the area of the triangle and $ s = \frac{a + b + c}{2} $ is the semi-perimeter.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Also, the **area** can be written in terms of the circumradius:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
