[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m r = \frac{abc}{4R s}
