[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 4: Use the fact that $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is a key geometric condition that can be used to relate the sides and the triangle’s properties.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
