[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 1: Set up equations based on the given information
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m #### First scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Distance = 9 km
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Speed = $ s $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Time = 4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Total time includes $ t $ minutes at the coffee shop
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Convert 4 hours to minutes: $ 4 \times 60 = 240 $ minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So, the time spent walking is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
