[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Convert to minutes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{s} \times 60 = \frac{540}{s} \text{ minutes}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Total time (walking + coffee shop) = 240 minutes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{540}{s} + t = 240 \tag{1}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m #### Second scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Distance = 9 km
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Speed = $ s + 2 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Time = 2 hours and 24 minutes = $ 2 + \frac{24}{60} = 2.4 $ hours = 144 minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So, the time spent walking is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Convert to minutes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} \times 60 = \frac{540}{s + 2} \text{ minutes}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Total time (walking + coffee shop) = 144 minutes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
