[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is a classic **stars and bars** problem:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m For a given $ (c, v, s) $, the number of ways to assign flavors is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \binom{9}{c} \cdot \binom{9 - c}{v} \cdot \binom{9 - c - v}{s}
