[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Now compute $ N \mod 1000 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
