[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 4: Solve in each interval
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We will solve $ f(x) = \frac{x}{34} $ in each of the intervals $ [-1, 1) $, $ [1, 3) $, and then repeat the pattern every 4 units.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Let’s go through each interval.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m #### **Interval 1: $ x \in [-1, 1) $**  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Here, $ f(x) = x $, so we solve:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m x = \frac{x}{34}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Subtract $ \frac{x}{34} $ from both sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m x - \frac{x}{34} = 0 \Rightarrow x\left(1 - \frac{1}{34}\right) = 0 \Rightarrow x = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So, $ x = 0 $ is a solution in this interval.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m #### **Interval 2: $ x \in [1, 3) $**  
