[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 2 - x = \frac{x}{34}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Multiply both sides by 34:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 34(2 - x) = x \Rightarrow 68 - 34x = x \Rightarrow 68 = 35x \Rightarrow x = \frac{68}{35}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is in the interval $ [1, 3) $, so it is valid.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So, $ x = \frac{68}{35} $ is a solution.
