[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m BD^2 = \frac{4\left(a^2 + \frac{6a^2}{5} - 24\right)}{\left( \frac{6a^2}{5} - 24 \right) - a^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
