[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Simplify numerator and denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Numerator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
