[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m BD^2 = \frac{4\left( \frac{11a^2}{5} - 24 \right)}{ \frac{a^2}{5} - 24 }
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
