[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Multiply both sides by $ a $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 5a^2 + 26 = 20a \Rightarrow 5a^2 - 20a + 26 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Now solve:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m a = \frac{20 \pm \sqrt{(-20)^2 - 4 \cdot 5 \cdot 26}}{2 \cdot 5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m = \frac{20 \pm \sqrt{400 - 520}}{10}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m = \frac{20 \pm \sqrt{-120}}{10}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is **complex**, which is a problem.
