[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### **Step 7: Use the Quadratic Equation**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We had:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
