[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m a = \frac{20 \pm \sqrt{400 - 520}}{10}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m = \frac{20 \pm \sqrt{-120}}{10}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is **complex**, which is **not possible** for a real length.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So, our assumption that the sequence is $ a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, \ldots $ must be wrong.
