[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $C = (-a, -b)$: same as $A$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $D = (-c, -d)$: same as $B$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So the four points are symmetric with respect to the origin.
