[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ 1 \leq c, v, s \leq 9 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ c > v > s \geq 1 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Let’s find all such triplets.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We can iterate over all possible values of $ s $, $ v $, and $ c $, but it's easier to find all such triplets.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We can list all possible triplets $ (c, v, s) $ such that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ c > v > s \geq 1 $
