[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Valid.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Try $ v = 4 $, then $ c = 9 - 1 - 4 = 4 $
