[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Convert to minutes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{4.35} \times 60 = \frac{540}{4.35} \approx 123.077 \text{ minutes}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We’ll round to the nearest minute, but since the question asks for the **exact** time including $ t $, and we already have $ t \approx 99.5122 $, we can now compute the **total time**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \text{Total time} = \frac{9}{s + 0.5} + \frac{t}{60}
