[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{s + 0.5} = \frac{9}{4.35} \approx 2.069 \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{t}{60} \approx \frac{99.5122}{60} \approx 1.6585 \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So total time:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
