[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $A = (x_1, y_1)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $B = (x_2, y_2)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $C = (x_3, y_3)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $D = (x_4, y_4)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m And the **diagonals** are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $AC: (x_1 + x_3, y_1 + y_3)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $BD: (x_2 + x_4, y_2 + y_4)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
