[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{x_2^2}{20} - \frac{y_2^2}{24} = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m And we are to **maximize** $BD^2$, and then **find the greatest real number less than $BD^2$**.
