[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### **Step 7: Find $ t $**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Use equation (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
