[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Substitute $ s = 2.5 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{2.5} + \frac{t}{60} = 4
