[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 7: Use the condition $\overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is a key condition. Let’s try to use vector geometry or coordinate geometry to exploit it.
