[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m OI^2 = 13^2 - 2 \cdot 13 \cdot 6 = 169 - 156 = 13
