[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 13: Use the formula for $IA$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We can use the formula for the length of the angle bisector from $A$ to the incenter $I$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
