[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m But we also know that $OI = \sqrt{13}$, and $IA \perp OI$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So we can use the Pythagorean theorem in the right triangle $IAO$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
