[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 14: Use the **known identity for the inradius and circumradius**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
