[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m abc = 2 \cdot 13 \cdot 6 \cdot (a + b + c) = 156(a + b + c)
