[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ AB = \sqrt{(13 - 0)^2 + (0 - b)^2} = \sqrt{169 + b^2} $
