[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is a **rhombus** with:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Diagonals $AC = 2x_1$, $BD = 2y_2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Diagonals are **perpendicular** (since it's a rhombus)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Diagonals intersect at the origin
