[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 4: Use formula for circumradius
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m The circumradius $ R $ of a triangle is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m R = \frac{abc}{4A}
