[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 7: Use the condition $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is a **key geometric condition**. Let’s try to use it.
