[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 13: Use the formula for $ AB \cdot AC $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We are to find $ AB \cdot AC = bc $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ abc = 312s $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ s = \frac{a + b + c}{2} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m But we also have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \sin \frac{A}{2} = \frac{\sqrt{39}}{13}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Use the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \sin \frac{A}{2} = \sqrt{\frac{(s - b)(s - c)}{bc}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \sqrt{\frac{(s - b)(s - c)}{bc}} = \frac{\sqrt{39}}{13}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Square both sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{(s - b)(s - c)}{bc} = \frac{39}{169}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m (s - b)(s - c) = \frac{39}{169} \cdot bc
