[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 14: Use the formula for $ s $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}
