[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m (s - b)(s - c) = \frac{a - b + c}{2} \cdot \frac{a + b - c}{2} = \frac{(a^2 - b^2 + c^2)}{4}
