[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 1: Use the relationship between $ IA $, $ OI $, and the triangle
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We are given that $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $, so the line segment $ IA $ is **perpendicular** to the line segment $ OI $.
