[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 2: Use the formula for the distance between the incenter and circumcenter
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m The distance between the incenter $ I $ and the circumcenter $ O $ is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
