[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This means that $ \angle AIO = 90^\circ $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So, triangle $ AIO $ is a **right triangle** with:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
