[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 4: Find all divisors of 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m The divisors of 56 are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \pm 1, \pm 2, \pm 4, \pm 7, \pm 8, \pm 14, \pm 28, \pm 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We are only interested in **positive** divisors, and we want:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m d > 16
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So we check which of these are greater than 16:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - 28
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So the valid values of $ d $ are:
