[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### **Step 6: Now we have two equations:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m From (2) and (3):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{s} \times 60 + t = 240 \quad \text{(1)}
