[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 8: Use the condition $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is a **key condition**. Let’s try to use it.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Let’s recall that in a triangle, the vector from the incenter $ I $ to the circumcenter $ O $ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \vec{OI} = \vec{O} - \vec{I}
