[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m And the vector from the incenter to the vertex is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \vec{IA} = \vec{A} - \vec{I}
