[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This is a vector dot product, and it implies:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m (\vec{A} - \vec{I}) \cdot (\vec{O} - \vec{I}) = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
