[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 9: Use known formula for $ IO^2 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We have the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
