[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 10: Use the fact that $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Let’s use the **law of cosines** in triangle $ OIA $, where:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
