[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We had:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m x_2 + x_{11} = x_2 + \frac{26}{5 x_2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Substitute $ x_2 = \frac{5 + 2\sqrt{3}}{5} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m First compute $ \frac{26}{5 x_2} $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m x_2 = \frac{5 + 2\sqrt{3}}{5} \Rightarrow \frac{1}{x_2} = \frac{5}{5 + 2\sqrt{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Rationalize the denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{1}{x_2} = \frac{5}{5 + 2\sqrt{3}} \cdot \frac{5 - 2\sqrt{3}}{5 - 2\sqrt{3}} = \frac{5(5 - 2\sqrt{3})}{25 - 12} = \frac{5(5 - 2\sqrt{3})}{13}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{26}{5 x_2} = \frac{26}{5} \cdot \frac{5(5 - 2\sqrt{3})}{13} = \frac{26(5 - 2\sqrt{3})}{13} = 2(5 - 2\sqrt{3}) = 10 - 4\sqrt{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Now compute:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m x_2 + x_{11} = \frac{5 + 2\sqrt{3}}{5} + 10 - 4\sqrt{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m First, compute $ \frac{5 + 2\sqrt{3}}{5} $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{5 + 2\sqrt{3}}{5} = 1 + \frac{2\sqrt{3}}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m x_2 + x_{11} = 1 + \frac{2\sqrt{3}}{5} + 10 - 4\sqrt{3} = 11 + \frac{2\sqrt{3}}{5} - 4\sqrt{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m = 11 - \frac{18\sqrt{3}}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
