[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \text{Area}(\triangle A_i A_1 A_{i+1}) = \frac{1}{2} | \vec{A_1 A_i} \times \vec{A_1 A_{i+1}} | = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
