[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We are told:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m #### Case 1: Speed $ s $, time = 4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - She walks 9 km at speed $ s $, so the time taken for the walk is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m   $$
