[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 2. $ \frac{9}{s + 2} + \frac{t}{60} = 2.4 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Subtract equation 2 from equation 1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \left( \frac{9}{s} - \frac{9}{s + 2} \right) + \frac{t}{60} - \frac{t}{60} = 4 - 2.4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m \frac{9}{s} - \frac{9}{s + 2} = 1.6
