[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 4: Use the formula for the length of $ IA $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m The length of the segment from the incenter to a vertex is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m IA = \frac{r}{\sin \frac{A}{2}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
