[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 5: Use the fact that $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We now have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ IA = \frac{6}{\sin \frac{A}{2}} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ OI = \sqrt{13} $
