[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m This means that the angle between $ \vec{IA} $ and $ \vec{OI} $ is $ 90^\circ $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So, the triangle $ OIA $ is a right triangle with:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
