[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So we are to find all integer bases $ b > 9 $ such that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
