[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So we need to write $ \frac{10}{3} $ in that form.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m But $ \frac{10}{3} = \frac{10 \cdot 1 - 0}{3} $
