[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m   $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m #### Case 2: Speed $ s + 2 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Distance = 9 km
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - Time = 144 minutes = 2 hours 24 minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - So, the time she spends walking is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m   $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m   \text{Walking time} = \frac{9}{s + 2} \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m   $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - The coffee shop time is still $ t $ minutes, so the total time is:
