[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ 97_b $ means $ 9 \cdot b + 7 = 9b + 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m We are to find all bases $ b > 9 $ such that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
