[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 1: Use the formula for the inradius
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m The inradius $ r $ of a triangle is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
