[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 3: Use vector or coordinate geometry
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Let’s try a **coordinate geometry approach**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
