[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m ### Step 2: Convert the numbers to base 10
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m Let’s convert $ 17_b $ and $ 97_b $ to base 10:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m - $ 17_b = 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7 $
