[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m But we can also use the **formula for the area** in terms of the sides and the cosine of an angle:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
