[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - 2bc \cdot \frac{13}{24} = b^2 + c^2 - \frac{13}{12} bc
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - \frac{13}{12} bc \tag{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=14021)[0m 
